      "value": "Here's a small 5-minute mockup of what @gunter would have experienced last night after he passed out on the dance floor and everyone flocked to him.\nTop lines are touching the top of the head.\nSide lines are the sides of the head.\nBottom lines are the body or legs, which get thinner the further from your head you're being touched (so feet would have a small \"footprint\", lel).\nBumps are shoulders.\nCould also add a wings indicator and a tail indicator.",
