  "details": "Physical interaction and indicators would be neat. A subtle UI indicator, like an outline around the headset relative to where you're getting touched which you can’t see unless someone acts on you.\n\nExample: If you’re touched on the shoulder, the UI would appear in the bottom left/right corner.\n\nAlso handholding as a \"pickup\".\nAnimals don't have hands but they can do some other interaction...",
